    "content" : "Note that ǫ1,2,3 are all proportional to X which contains a double suppression factor. This feature was the main ingredient for the compatibility of the D-BESS model with the EW precision tests. In the ﬁve dimensional formulation of this model the ratio (g/g¯5)2 originates from the presence of brane localized kinetic terms."
